# k.actions/shards/verbs-connect: 18 verbs and phrasal verbs that mean the act "connect" (connect, link, link up, join, attach, fasten, couple, hook up ...): the WordNet senses read for it, the role of the object, what the verb itself says, and the prepositions that mark a role after this verb.
